    "Name": "Tiburon 2",
    "Details": "Fast and well-armed for its weight, the Tiburon 2 can be used in scout and attack formations alike. Mounting a pair of heavy medium lasers in each arm, and backed up by two SRM-2 launchers and twin ER small lasers, the Tiburon 2 can quickly close with an enemy and inflict damage before moving out of range again. Making matters worse for its opponents, the Tiburon carries a Watchdog CEWS to not only interfere with their electronics, but also assist in finding them from farther distances, and the lasers are all connected to an accurate targeting computer.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Tiburon"
  },
